    "font" : "SFRM1095",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The theorem can be deduced from the work of Wilton, by a modification of his application of Voronoi’s summation formula, but the proof we present here will be elementary in the sense that it relies on no complex analysis, and in fact only on elementary properties of α-continued fractions as established, e.g., in [LMNN10]."
