    "font" : "SFRM1095",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Since the odd part B− and the even part W+ of the Brjuno respectively Wilton functions are uniformly bounded functions — see Proposition 2.1 for closed form expressions — the functions of interest following Theorem 1.1 are the differences"
  }, {
